<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals reach 2.67 mln bags by Jan 26.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals reach 2.67 mln bags by Jan 26.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia 1996/97 cocoa arrivals totalled 2,670,902 million 60-kg bags by the week ending January 26 compared with 2,350,909 bags by January 28 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>Arrivals in the two weeks from January 13 to January 26 were as follows in 60-kg bags.</p>
<p> WEEK		  1996/97	     1995/96	    1994/95</p>
<p> Jan 13-19	    37,517		54,040	     66,660</p>
<p> Jan 20-26	    36,649		28,440	     57,424</p>
<p>--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417</p>
</text>
